@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC09 — Configure site or course author policy: conversation
top to bottom direction
state "1. Open policy settings\nPolicy manager" as S1
state "2. Read effective policy\nauthor_policy" as S2
state "3. Choose permitted value\nPolicy manager" as S3
state "4. Validate and save policy\nauthor_policy" as S4
state "5. Show confirmation\nPolicy manager" as S5
state "Refused / blocked outcome" as Refused
[*] --> S1
S1 --> S2
S2 --> S3
S3 --> S4
S4 --> S5
S5 --> [*]
S3 -right-> Refused
note bottom of Refused
See the use-case alternatives.
No unsupported write is permitted.
end note
@enduml
